{"text": "Taking two torches, I led Fortunato down a long and winding staircase into the deep vaults of the Montresor family. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The nitre, he said, looking at the white webs that shone on the walls, and then he began to cough. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Let us go back, because your health is precious, and you are rich, respected, and loved, just as I once was, I said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The cough is nothing, and it will not kill me, he answered, I shall not die of a cough. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> True, true, I replied, and I gave him a bottle of fine wine from a long row lying on the damp ground. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He lifted the bottle to his lips and said with a smile, I drink to the dead who lie around us. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And I drink to your long life, I answered, and we walked on deeper into the earth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Our family arms show a golden foot crushing a snake, and our motto means No one attacks me without being punished. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Later, when he asked whether I was one of the masons, a secret brotherhood, I told him that I was. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Here is my sign, I said, and I pulled a small trowel from under my cloak, but he only laughed at my joke.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "a", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "t", "o", "r", "c", "h", "e", "s", ",", " ", "I", " ", "l", "e", "d", " ", "F", "o", "r", "t", "u", "n", "a", "t", "o", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", " ", "a", " ", "l", "o", "n", "g", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", "i", "n", "g", " ", "s", "t", "a", "i", "r", "c", "a", "s", "e", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "e", "e", "p", " ", "v", "a", "u", "l", "t", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "M", "o", "n", "t", "r", "e", "s", "o", "r", " ", "f", "a", "m", "i", "l", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "n", "i", "